OL,3,GNEWSAHawk fighter jets to resume flying
OL,4,Aat RAF Valley after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FHigh-speed Hawk fighter jets will
OL,7,Fresume flying out of RAF Valley after
OL,8,Ftwo pilots ejected and parachuted out
OL,9,Fof their plane moments before it
OL,10,Fcrashed last month.
OL,12,FThe Hawk T2 aircraft had been flying
OL,13,Fout of the RAF Valley base on Anglesey
OL,14,Fwhen it plummeted to the ground at
OL,15,Fnearby Pencarnisiog, narrowly missing
OL,16,Fhomes.
OL,18,FThe RAF previously decided to pause
OL,19,FHawk operations while investigations
OL,20,Fwere ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
