OL,3,GNEWSAHawk fighter jets to resume flying
OL,4,Aat RAF Valley after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt meant the Red Arrows were also
OL,7,Ftemporarily grounded following the
OL,8,Fcrash but resumed later that week.
